## Data availability

### ERA5-Land

The ERA5-Land data used in this study are available on Figshare:

[ERA5-Land data used for compound hot–wet extreme analysis](https://doi.org/10.6084/m9.figshare.33734311)

### CMIP6/ISIMIP3b

The original bias-adjusted CMIP6 data are publicly available from the ISIMIP data repository:

[ISIMIP data repository](https://data.isimip.org/)
